admin-audit-ai-enabled = 啟用 AI 玩家
admin-audit-ai-disabled = 停用 AI 玩家
admin-audit-ai-settings-changed = 變更全部 AI 的設定
admin-audit-ai-runner-token-created = 建立 AI runner 權杖
admin-audit-ai-runner-token-revoked = 撤銷 AI runner 權杖
